  "label": "Stereotype of forced identity change as a form of dehumanization",
  "description": "The visual of chained hands on a blank sheet of paper, combined with the text, symbolizes the forced imposition of a new identity. This is a metaphorical stereotype used to depict the erasure or alteration of a person's identity, often used in racist or Islamophobic contexts to demean targeted groups. This concept is not directly visible but is implied by the image and text.",
